<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2C- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Okorenti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus komwepa da Ase ko Okorenti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Okorenti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Okr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus komwepa da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Okorenti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Okpa mani bwebe ko Obulus, Oyikoko ko Okristi Oyesu byoni Owuso yimu ni, kpo oyene ka aha Otimoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Nyya toleho ko okpa mani gebe ka awogboso Oyesu ni bo Okorentus ni, kpase ko Owuso kpiri ni bo okpagye ka Akaya ni.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Owuso Ada kaha kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi na dalo oneshi kpo omene.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Shotunehe do Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ahan shotunehe do Owuso Ada ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi, Ada kiyinyiynyi, Owuso ni ya kase otu agye ni! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Anu tahabo ipu ko owe kaha kpiri, shini ahan ta ashini kase ni bipu ko owe moma wonyonya ni abo, byoni Owuso tahabo ni. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Byoni aha gbingbo ipu kowe moma ko Okristi ni, mamani bwebe ko Okristi aha gbingbo ipu ko otabo ko Owuso. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Owoni aha mowe, owikweyi kabo tota kala kpo ongmongma kala la; owoni Owuso tahabo, mani oni aha ba talabo ki daloshu ko zotu kpo omene kedo ko owe oyekponu ni aha ba ma ni. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Mani oni, iyitagye kaha ikweyi kala ya ja lo; ikweyi koni aha gye kamo byoni ala ba mowe kpa aha ni, mamani ala Owuso ya talabo kpaha dudu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ayene kaha, aba yimu ko ra la, kowe ni aha ma okpagye ka Asiya ni. Iyo ni agwo saha ni gyokwu kweyi olenu shahoshu, gbishini agye kamo aba gbolayi kelo. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Ama byo akwaha epwo kikwu la. Omani ke gbodagye shini an ka totu siyikaha lo, oke gbodagye shini an totuso Owuso la, anu ni ya yokwu ya nyiso ni. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ongma aha shi ikwu mani, oki ya ngma aha; kweyi aha totuso mo oki ya ngmaha, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />byoni ala ba tahabo kpi inarigwu ni ala bata daha ni. Ebeni Owuso ya pwinarigwu kala kpiri ni ala ba ta daha ni, kweyi Owuso ya saha aboneshi; kweyi ase nwashika ba zoko giso danu ko shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi kaha.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Yoza ni Ogbo ko Yoya yi Pya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Aha ba gwabotu koni otu kaha ka daha mo oyagye kaha ese mani kpema rore kaha kpala, aha yojoji ipu kokwokwoshi kpotu neshi bwebe koshu keshi ko Owuso, woziyi kasuse lalo. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Aha tokpa koza ni ala ba maka kyi bagye ni la. Kweyi aha yotuse kamo, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />koni ala ke gye kweyi lo ni, ayotuse mala bawa gye kpiri-kpiri, shini ala gwabotu kpaha byoni aba wa gwabotu kpala eno ka Adole Oyesu ni.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ngye mani kpiri, pini ngbomu ko webe kala ikyikyo la, shini ala pya abola igbepa. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ngbomu ko bwebe kala ishini nyyowe ko Omasedoniya kpishi ni nyya kwikye ni, shini ala tumabo owe kiyawu ko go Oyahudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ishini ngbomu mani ni, nzo kpigiga la? Kwe ngbomu hin byase kese la, ko kyogwu mo &lt;&lt;Olemani, olemani kpo aayi, aayi,&gt;&gt; ishi oye kponu la? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Byoni Owuso ya kokwokwoshi ni, okoyi hin dala wo &lt;&lt;Olemani&gt;&gt; kpo &lt;&lt;Aayi&gt;&gt; la lo. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Koni Oyesu Okristi, Oyi ko Owuso, ni ya tono ebe kala kpo Osila Otimoti kpami abiyun Obulus, kada la ikweyi nu ni wolamu ni wo &lt;&lt;Nalemani kpo aayi,&gt;&gt; la lo, ke woye gogo, owo &lt;&lt;Nalemani&gt;&gt; ko Owuso la; <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Koni anu pini wo &lt;&lt;Nalemani&gt;&gt; koyi Owuso kpiri. Omani pini ya bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi &lt;&lt;Nalemani&gt;&gt; ka aba ka digyashi ko Owuso la. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Owuso abwenu pini yaha la, dudu kpa ala, gyokwoshi ka ipu ko dudu kpo Okristi; Owuso abwenu pini kpaha shaka la, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />anu ni kyi myoyi kinoza ikpiye ka, kweyi kamo aha wa kaka nu. Okyi daha Omaku ko Owuso ipu kotu ka byoni oshokoyi kpaha mo oya daha oza kpiri ni shagye daha ni. <verse eid="2CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nyya yo Owuso ogwu na wiwene hin, ogyotu hin! Ikweyi kala pini nggo Okorentus ke lo la, shini naka wegye dala lo. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Aba yimu ko yala shini ala kyogwu koshu lo. Aha ke ba yoko kpala dudu ikweyi kotunehe kala la, ikweyi koni aha gye mo ala hagye loshu ipu kotuse ni.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Mani oni, nze ipu kotu hin mo nyya wa yotu kala naka bya kelo. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Owoni nyyo otu kala bya, anoho yaba ko kami otu agye, ala ni nyyo otu kala bya ni lalo? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Oza ni yun tokpa oni dala ni oma, nyya yimu ko webe kala lo ela koni ala ni shu ko kamotu agye ni ga yotu hin ya bya ni. Koni nkyogwu ipu kotu hin mo owoni otu hin sha otu kala kpiri ba sha mamani. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ntokpa mani dala ipu kotu byobya nwashika kpize iyi; nyya yimu ko yotu kala na bya la lo, nke ya yimu shini ala gyedo kimu ni ngbo dala ni la.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Rigbase ni Yozalabi ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Anani, owoni ashe yotu kashe bya, oyun fufun la lo, oke yala kpiri la. (Nka mani ikweyi koni nyya yimu ko kela labi danu lo.) <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Owe ni ase nwashika ipu kala gbogo agye ni gbayi anu. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Anani ke, ala rigbo kweyi totugbagba, shini otu nu naka bya ko yo na kwikye itikpi lo. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mani oni, nyya bala mala yo nagye mala ba yimu nu kotata. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ntokpa oni dala shina ma kwe ipu kishi kpiri ala ba hagye loshu kweyi ba yoko kpe ela hin ipu kojoji. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ishini ala yozalabi ni ase ya ni gbuwa, ami rigbuwa mamani. Kweyi owoni nrigbase kwokwoshi, nrigbuwa obutu ko Okristi ikweyi kala, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />shini Ibiri naka pyowe ko gyaha egya lo, ikweyi koni aha kwobonu gyoza ni oya gbo ni.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otudose ko Obulus Ipu Kogya ko Otrowas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ishini nwwogya ko Otrowas ko tono ko Oshu Neshi ko Okristi ni, Adole gwowe koko dami ebe ni. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Otu hin ke sha lo, ikweyi koni nmo oyene kaha ko Otitus ebeni lo ni. Nka dawase ni bebeni kamo nyya ga hin oma, kweyi nkwowe go Omasedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Orore Bwebe ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Nke shotunehe do Owuso! Ikweyi koni ipu ko dudu kpo Okristi, Owuso yoko kpaha byase na shuwotu ni kweyi kpogwu kawo refu ipu ko Okristi. Owuso yoko kpaha ko koshu ko Okristi ebebenya byoza kpehe. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Koni aha le byoza kpehe no Okristi peshi do Owuso, ni kpehe ge ebebenya ipu kawase ni angmawa ni kpawase ni gebi owe ni. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ebe kawase ni gebi ni, owoza kwipi labi ko yase ngmo; ebe kawase ni ake ngmawa ni, owoza kpehe ko dase olayi. Anoho ke gye ko yoko mani? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Aha le byase nwashika ni ba kyoleho ko Owuso ko pyoza kese ni lalo, ake wayole ko Owuso kokwokwoshi la, kweyi aba kyoleho ko Owuso bwebe koshu ko Okristi.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayole ko Okoyi Pepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ala bama byo aki ba ba gwabotu ikweyi kiyi kaha? Kwe ala bama mo ale byase ashini, ni ba doka ko okpa ko olobene ko dala kwe ala ko daha la? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ala abiyikala pini wo okpa kaha la, tota ipu kotu kaha, ase kpiri gye kweyi aba maka.<verse eid="2CO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Owokwokwoshi Okristi abiyinu pini tokpa mani kweyi toleho daha la. Otokpa mani kpinyi kenena lalo, oke ta kpo Omaku ko Owuso la, ikweyi kikyikpo lalo, ipu kotu kasuse la.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Aka mani ikweyi koni atotuso Owuso bwebe ko Okristi ni. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ojije yipu kaha ni ya yaha ziyikala mo aba gege ko yoko mani lo. Oshu kaha ke bwebe ko Owuso la; <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />anu pini yaha gboshu ko yawo oko ko okoyi pepe mani la. Okoyi pepe mani wako ono ni ayitota ni la lo, oke wa ko Omaku ko Owuso la. Ono ni ayitota ni ya byikwu wa, Omaku ko Owuso ke ya dase olayi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ayo Ono tota we enena ikweyi ki ikyikpo, kweyi igyashi ko Owuso ke bose loshu loshu ishini ado Omusa ni. Oyoyu kaheyi ko Omusa kwotu ko gebi, kwikikyeni oloshu shoshu koni ase ki Izrayila ba ayiyi kwo ni, owoni ono ni ya byi ikwu wa ni, wa kpi igyashi mani, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />oshu kigyashi koko ko Omaku ko Owuso ya she mani lo? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Owoni oko ni ya ngmase ni gbigyashi, oko kigyashi ni yaha waseneshi ni ya lemoji? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Aba gege ko ka mani ikweyi kigyashi ni yayu kotata anani shigyashi ni yayu nekye-nekye ni. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Owoni oza ni yaba kishi gbayayi ni gbigyashi, igyashi koza ni ya rese kogbogbo-gbogbo ni ya lemoji?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ikweyi koni ayotuse mani, ikpiye kaha loshu neshi. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Alema byo Omusa la lo, ni ya yakyi kiyi nu shini ase ki Izrayila naka mo sosa koyoyu kweyi gebi ni. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Otu wa, gwu, kwokwoshi; kweyi kwikyikyeni otu wa gwogwu kpayikyi oye ishini aba kokpa ko okoyi nekye ni, aki oni ya gwa kin ishini ase mani yipu ko dudu kpo Okristi la. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kwikyikyeni, ishi kpiri akokpa ko Ono ko Omusa, akyi yoyo yuwotu gwu. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Oke ya gwa, byoni Okpa ko Owuso ka ikweyi ko Omusa mo: &lt;&lt;Akyi ko Omusa gwa ishini opya wobutu ka Adole.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Anani, Adole ipu kela mani pini wo Omaku la; kweyi ebe ni Omaku ka Adole yanu, Adole ya ngmaha. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Kweyi kpiri kaha ba mi igyashi ka Adole kpa aheyi kaha gwogwa; kpi igyashi bwebe ka Adole, ni wo Omaku ni, ko yaha pya le byanu ipu kigyashi nu ni shi igyashi kpiri ni.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Odu Ipu ke Eyi ka Agye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Owuso ipu kiyinyinyi nu odaha oko mani koyoya, mani oni kweyi aha ba gbotu lo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Aha shoza ni aba ya teba kpo oza ki iweyi bita; aha ba gyase egya kelo, kwe aba yela ko Owuso ya wokame lo. Aha bagye ipu ko oyoyu neshi ko Owuso. Akyi ba takirikwu ko sayi kotu neshi kaha dananoho obutu ko Adole. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Owoni oshu neshi ni aba tono ni teba, oteba ebe kase ni gebi owe ni kin la. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Awa ke kyogwu lo, ikweyi koni awowuso ko oyi mani yuwotu gwu, shini anaka mo oyoyu koshu neshi ki igyashi ko Okristi ni wo oyi ko Owuso ni lo. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Aba tono ikweyi kiyikaha lalo; aba tono mo Oyesu Okristi wa Adole, aha abiyikaha ke wayole wo ikweyi ko Oyesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Owuso ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Bwipu kebe dibu ola ya yu!&gt;&gt; ni, ananu pini wo Owuso ni yola nu yu ipu kotu kaha la, shini na wa daha ogyogye kigyashi ko Owuso ni yayu aheyi ko Oyesu Okristi ni.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kwikyikyeni aha ni gbo odu ko Omaku ko Owuso mani lema byo eyi ka agye la, shini na shaha mo Owuso pini gbo oshu nyaku ko ojoji la, aha lalo. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Aha mowe ishi nwashika, aha ke kya lo; Ishi shishini aba byotu, aha ke nyowe lo; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />adahowe nwashika, Owuso ke shahabita lo; ishi shishini agwaha agye, ake ngmaha lo. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ishi kpiri aba zikwu ko Oyesu ipu kikpiye ka ni ya gekwu ni, shini ana mo olayi nu mamani ipu kikpiye ka. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ishi kpiri ipu koyagye kaha abo okwunu kikwu ikweyi ko Oyesu, shini ana mo olayi nu ipu kikpiye kaha ni ya gekwu ni. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Omani ya sayi mo ikwu yoko ipu kaha, olayi ke ya yoko ipu kala.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Nka ikweyi koni ntotuse ni.&gt;&gt; Ipu ko Omaku kotuse oye kponu akyi ka mamani ikweyi koni akyogwu ni. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Agye mo Owuso, ni ya Adole Oyesu nyiso bwikwu ni, ya yaha ba nyiso kpo Oyesu kweyi ya kpaha kpa ala go obutu nu. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Kpiri mani wako oneshi kala la; kweyi byo ni eshi ko Owuso ya febe kase lewewa mani, awa ba shotunehe digyashi ko Owuso kpi inarigwu lewewa kotunehe keshi no dawa ni.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyagye Bwebe ko Otuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ikweyi koni aba gbotu lo. Koni ikpiye kaha ya gekwu ni, kwikyikyeni ikpiye kaha ko Omaku ya wopepe kurutu. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kweyi owe moma kishi gbayayi mani ya byi igyashi ko gbogbo-gbogbo yawa, ni loshu sho owe kpiri ni. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Koni aziyi kaha kwo oza ni aba mani lalo, oza ni aba ma lo ni la. Ikweyi koni oza ni aba ma ni ya rese kishi gbayayi la, oza ni iyi ke yama lo ni ya rese ko gbogbo-gbogbo.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Aha gye mo ishini aya adaba ni abanu mani kye, ni wikpiye kaha kese mani, Owuso ya daha ole ko bagye ko gbogbo-gbogbo ipu ki iso ni womoma kabo kasuse lalo ni. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Anani ke aba fotu, ikweyi koni aba showu ko gole kaha kiso ni wikpiye kaha pepe ni; <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ishini oshaha oshiye mani, aba yewewa kelo. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ishini abe ese mani ni, aba fotu koni aba dahowe ni. Aba yimu ko gekwu shini an shikpiye kese mani bita lalo, ake ba yimu kole kiso ko wa yaha gwu la, shini olayi na yikpiye kaha ko gekwu mani me. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Owuso pini kwobonu yaha ko shi ikpiye mani la, odaha Omaku nu ko woyi koza ni ogbo shagye daha ni.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Mani oni, ipu kishi kpiri aha hagye loshu. Koni agye mo owoni aha bipu kikpiye aha bebe lenu kpole ko Owuso. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Aha gbolayi bwebe ko otuse la, bwebe koza ni aha ba ma ni lalo. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Aha gbikpiye loshu, kweyi Aba yimu ko shole ka bita ipu kikpiye shi ahan gabagye ole ka Adole. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Oni shojoji ni, yoma aba yimu ko ya Adole otusha, ole mani, kwipu kole ka Adole. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Koni kpiri kaha ba wa bose obutu ko Okristi shini ona kepwo kaha. Ananoho kaha ya nya abola ko oza ni oya ni gyogye kpoza kpiri naha ya ipu kikpiye kaha ni, oneshi kwe olabi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoya kpo Owuso Bwebe ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Aha gye mo oshoshi ko yoshi ka Adole, mani oni aba takirikwu ko ka dase ashini. Owuso gyaha kpiri-kpiri, nki totuse mo ala gyun ipu kotu kala mamani. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Aba takirikwu ko kiyikaha dala lalo, ake ba takirikwu shini ala moza ko kaha abiyikala, shini ala gyoza ko ka dase ni ba gwabotu kpo omoma kiyi kase, abishi koza yoya kase ni. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Kokwokwoshi aha wo nyoza la? Owoni aha nyoza aha nyoza abishi ko Owuso la. Kwe anyoza lo? Owoni aha nyoza lo aha nyoza lo abishi kala la. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Imu ko Okristi pini ya kpaha ogwu la, anani ni aha wa gye mo ongo oye gekwu ikweyi kase kpiri ni, kpiri kase gbingbo ipu kikwu nu. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ogekwu dase kpiri, shini ase ni biyi ni naka bagye diyiwa kelo, ana ke bagye da anu fufunu ni gekwu dawa kweyi Owuso kiyo nyiso kpo olayi abishi wa.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Aba kwashishe epwo komoma kasuse kelo. Koni akwo Okristi epwo owe kepwo koka kasuse ni, nabani aba ya mani kelo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Aseni yipu ko Okristi owase pepe. Onekye shigbo, opepe wa. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Kpiri koza mani Owuso pini ya la, bwebe ko Okristi oyaha awomonyekwotu nu pya wawoya nu, kweyi daha oko ko yase ashini pya wawoya nu mamani. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Oko ni odaha ni yoma: Owuso ya yase kese kpiri ba wawoya nu bwebe ko Okristi. Owuso yozalabi wa ta tagye lo, kweyi otaha oleho ko tono ko yase pya wawoya nu. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Mani oni aha pini ba kela abishi ko Okristi la, byo Owuso abiyinu ya kela dala bwebe kaha. Aba bala okwunu ko Okristi: ala bwo omonyekwotu ko Owuso shini ala pya wawoya nu! <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Okristi gbo ozalabi lo, Owuso ke yo gbingbo kozalabi kaha, shini aha an waseneshi dudu kpanu ebe ko Owuso.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Mani oni, ipu koko kaha dudu kpo Owuso, aba bala ni zeshi ko Owuso ni mala ka yona woyeye lo. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Pwoza ni Owuso kani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Owoni ishi ya dami ko miyinyinyi kala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Nyya pwala;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">ishi ni eno gye dami ko ngmala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Nyya tala abo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Alapwo! Anani wishi kiyinyinyi ko Owuso; ikyeni weno ni ya ngma la!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Aba yimu shini ashishe na kwahepwo bwebe koko ka lo, mani oni aha takirikwu shini anka yashishe owe gwu lo. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Abishi ko ni, ipu kojoji ni aba ya ni aha sayi kiyika mo ayole ko Owuso bwebe ko zotu kyi gbo otumene kpowe, enyo kpo ozalono. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Agwaha ize, ayaha shetu, ashawa ikweyi ka; ayaha yoko shiyika oshu ke eno ko otu, aha gbola ake roza lo. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Bwebe kotu neshi ka, kpo ogyogye, kpo ozotu, kpo otu mene, aha sayi maha wayole ko Owuso, bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso kpi imu kaha ko kwokwoshi. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Owoni ako kwokwoshi, kpo oshu ko Owuso. Oneshi ko yoya wiyo kefu ka, ko kpefu kpa ko gbiyi ka. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Adaha abokpa kweyi kyi tahanye, akoneshi ka akyi kolabi ka, abo kwokwoshi, mo aba gyase egya; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Agyaha ake mawa gyaha lo, akamo agekwu, ake, tayayo gbo olayi. Agwaha ize, ake yaha ngmaha lo. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Ayotu ka bya ake ba shotunehe ishi kpiri; awoleha, ake yase nwashika wolodu; ale bya gbojije lo, ake gbojoji kpiri.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ayene hin ko Okorentus! Akela kotata dala; kweyi ayotu ka gwa kpiri dala. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Aha pini yotu ka gwu dala lalo; ala pini yotu kala gwu daha la. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Nyya kela dala byayi hin: Ala gwotu kala daha byoni aha gwotu kaha dala ni. Ala gwotu kala kpiri!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ikweyi kawo Geyagye de Eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ka rema kase ni tela ko kyogwu kpo Owuso ni lo, oya ya lo. Oneshi kpo obibi ba rema kiyiwa lo, oyoyu kpe ebe dibu ba bagye dudu lo. <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Oji yo Okristi kpi ibiri ba kyogwu kpiyiwa? Oji ni inogboso Oyesu gbo ko ya kpase ni kyogwu lo ni? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Okoyi wonya ni ole ko Owuso gbo kpe eka? Aha pini wole ko Owuso ni gbo olayi ni la! Byoni Owuso abiyinu ka mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;&lt;Nyya yole kpawase hin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">nyya yagye ipu wa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Nyya wo Owuso wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">kweyi awa ba wase hin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Mani pini Adole kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">&lt;&lt;Bose shipu wa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">shini ogogo kpawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ka gabo oza ni awobi ni lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kweyi nyya kyogwu kpala.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Adole ine koshu pini kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">&lt;&lt;Nyya wa Ada kala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">kweyi ala ba wayi hin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ayene hin moshi, Kpiri ko okoyi mani Owuso she daha la. Mani oni, an yiyika na sho oza kpiri ni ya yi ikpiye kpo omaku kaha yishi ni. Kweyi an wase sere kpiri-kpiri bwebe ko geyagye do Owuso.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otunehe ko Obulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ala yaha tipu kotu kala. Aha ya ashishe ozalabi lo; aha ya ashishe yishi lo; ake gyashishe egya lo. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Nka mani koya ala ishi lalo; koni, byoni nkwobonu ka, Ala bipu kotu ka ishi kpiri, ko owoni abiyi kwe agekwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nyya totu sala; nyya gwabotu kpala! Ipu ko owe moma ka kpiri ala tumotugbagba; nyya shotunehe nwashika.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Koni ishini awo Omasedoniya ni, aha ke minyo lo. Owe moma yebebenya, ase ashini ba gbapwo, oshi yaha kwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Owuso ni ke ya tawo byotu otugbagba ni, otahotugbagba bwebe ko owowa ko Otitus. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Owowa nu fufunu pini tahabo lalo, oshu ni obiwa mala totugbagba ni ki tahotugbagba mamani. Oka daha mala ba yimu ko mun, omala ba byotu kotata ikweyi hin, kweyi ba zokwunu hin; mani oni otu hin nwonwu kpo otunehe anani.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Owoni okpa ni ntoleho ni yotu kala bya, nzobigye ko ta lo. Nbi ya zobigye koni nmo byalotu kishi gbayayi ni. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Anani ke nshotunehe, ikweyi koni nyyotu kala bya ni lalo, koni otu byobya kala yala shagbotu ni la. Owuso yoko kpo otubyobya mani, mani oni ayala ofo kojije lo. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Koni Otubyobya ni wa ko Owuso ya yase ya shagbotu ni ya dase olayi ni, otubyobya mani gbo obigye lo. Otubyobya kese mani ke ya byikwu wa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Mo oza ni Owuso ya kpotu byobya kala mani: oyala zo kpigiga lo, oyala ba yimu ko sayi mala gbepwo lo! Oyala yanya ki ba yoshi, oyala dotose, oyala ziyikala danu, oyala ba yimu ko yoza gyogye, Ipu koza mani kpiri ala shami mala yojoji gyogye ipu kela mani.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Mani oni, ntokpa oni dala ikweyi kaseni ni yo ozalabi kwe aseni ayo ozalabi ni lalo. Nke ta shini ala gye mala ziyikala daha kotata ebe ko Owuso. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ozani tahotugbagba ni oma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Atahotugbagba kin lalo; Otitus yaha shotunehe ikweyi ko otunehe nu ni kpiri kala tabo ko kanotu agye ni! <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ngwabotu ikweyi kala danu, kweyi ala ke tumiweyi lo. Byoni ojoji ni aka dala wokwokwoshi ni, mamani ojoji ni agwabotu do Otitus ikweyi kala ni wokwokwoshi. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kweyi imu ni ogbo dala ni ki shakikyikyo, ishini ora mo kpiri kala ba geyagye dela nu ni, ni ala yomaba kpo oshi kpi ikpiye sode ni. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Nshotunehe ni nyya gege ko yotu sala kpiri-kpiri!<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Eshi Zoze ka Awogboso Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ayene kaha, aba yimu shini ala gyoza ni eshi ko Owuso ya ipu kawoda ko Owuso ni bokpagye ko Omasedoniya ni. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Owuso muwama nwashika bwebe ko owe ni ama ni; otunehe wa ke nwashika ni azeshi kpotu wa oye kponu ni, koni agbeha ni. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nyya gege ya ka dala mo azoza ni agbo ni, aki ze pyoshu kiyiwa. Bwipu kotu wa <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />abaha ki ba shagye shini ana gbabo owe ko zeshi dase ko Owuso ni bo Oyahudiya ni. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Aya sho oza ni akpiyi shagye ni! Ikyikyo aziyiwa da Adole ome; kweyi aki ziyiwa daha mamani bwebe kimu ko Owuso. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Mani oni, abo Otitus, anu ni kwotu koko mani ni, mo ona gohobu kpanu kweyi na talabo shini ala ngmeyi ko oko kimu mani. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Byoni ala ke ba gohobu ipu kojoji ni: ipu ko otuse, ipu kela koka, ipu ko ogyogye, ipu kimu ko tasabo kpi imu ni ala gbo daha ni. Mamani aba yimu shini ala gbotu ko zoza ipu koko kimu mani.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Nyya kwo ono oyoye dala lo. Nke ya sayi kimu ni ase ashini gbo ko tasabo ni, nyya yimu ko gye kwe imu kala wa ko okwokwoshi la. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ala gye eshi ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi; koni owo olodu ni, oyiyinu woleha ikweyi kala, shini bwebe ke eha nu ala wolodu.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Nyya dalela mo oshoshi shini ala ngmeyi koza ni ala kwotu koyoya ishayi ni shigbo ni. Ala pini wa kikyikyo la, koyoya kin lalo, ko ki gbotu ko yoya. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Ala gohobu ko ya mani, kweyi ala ngmeyi koko ni! Ala gbimu ko ngmeyi nu bya ala ba kwotu oni, kweyi ala ze gyogye kpoza ni ala gbo ni. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Owoni ala gbimu ko ze, Owuso ya nyeshi kala bwebe ko oza ni ala gbo ko ze ni la, wako oza ni ala gbo lo ni lalo.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Nyya yimu shini ala mowe ko tase shishini abo lalo; koni ala ke gbo nwashika anani, oshoshi ko tase ni gbo lo ni abo. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Kweyi, ishini ala gbo lo awa ke gbo nwashika, aba talabo mamani. Owoni ala ya mani ananoho yapye gyogye. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso ka ni, &lt;&lt;Ase ni kpo tukpa nwashika ni gbo nwashika lo, kweyi ase ni kpo tukpa gbayayi, gbo gbayayi kin lalo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otitus Kpa Awoya Koko Nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Aha shotunehe do Owuso ni yo Otitus gbimu ko talabo byoni aha ba yimu ko ya ni! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Okyogwu koni aha bo ni kin lalo; anu abiyinu gbimu ko talabo, oza ni yo webe kala ni oma. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Aba toyene oye oleho yawa kpo Otitus, anu ni aba mo gyiyi ipu kawoda ko Owuso kpiri ikweyi koko nu tono ko Oshu Neshi. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Oni fufunu lalo, awoda ko Owuso sho mona byahoshi gebe ko yoko kimu mani ikweyi kigyashi ka Adole ko ki sayi mo aba yimu ko tabo.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Aba gbera shini ashishe naka kakyose ikweyi ko owe ni aba yoko kpeshi kotukyokye mani lo. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Aha ba yimu ko yoza ni gyogye ni, iyi ka Adole kin lalo, kiyi kasuse mamani.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Mani oni, aba toyene kaha oleho kpawa; aha moma ishi lewewa kweyi amo gbimu ishi kpiri ko tasabo. Anani oki gbimu nwashika ko talabo, ikweyi koni okyogwu kpala ni. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Otitus ke woya koko hin la, oya yoko kpami ko talabo; ayene shishini ni ba ga kpanu ni, wo okwunu kawoda ko Owuso kweyi wigyashi ko Okristi. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Mani oni, ala shawa imu ni ala gbo ni, shini awoda ko Owuso kpiri na ma na ki gye mo agwabotu kpala yeye lalo.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Otabo ko Awogboso Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Oshu koni nyya ta dala ikweyi koza ko tabo ko toleho ga dase ko Owuso ipu Oyahudiya kelo. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ngye mala gbimu ko tuwabo, kweyi ngwabotu ikweyi kala dase ko Omasedoniya. Ya ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Ayene ka kokpagye ka Akaya ba yimu ko tabo bwi ishayi ni ga ni.&gt;&gt; Kweyi imu ko tabo kala tase lewa ipu wa otugbagba ko ya mamani. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Nke ya tayene mani oleho ebe kala shini ogwabotu kaha ikweyi kala naka woyeye lo. Byoni nke ka ni, ala ba wiyikala shu kpoza ni ala gbo ko tabo ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Owoni ase ko Omasedoniya wa kpami kweyi wa mala wiyikalashu lo, aha ba gbowuru, owuru gbogbo kala ki ya shakaka, ikweyi koni aha gwabotu kpala kotata ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Mani oni nmamo oshu koni nyya tayene mani oleho ohobu hin gebe kala ome, shini ana ga kyo ojoji tu ikweyi keshi ko otukyokye ni ala shokoyi ni. Shini nawa tojoji yo gyogye ishini nwwa, kweyi oya sayi mala zeshi mani kotukyokye kala la, ayala ze koshu lalo.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Ala ra kamo aseni tizire gbayayi oya kye gbayayi, aseni ke tizire nwashika oya kye nwashika. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Ananoho na zo oza ni ogbo ipu kotu nu ko ze ni, woza ko zobigye kwe ako oshu lalo; koni Owuso ya yimu kaseni ya zeshi kpotunehe ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Kweyi Owuso ya gege ko dala shoza ni ala ba doka ni, kweyi ipu kishi kpiri ala ba gbojoji ni ala ba doka ni, kiyikala kpako yoko neshi kpiri. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso ka ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;Ozeshi nu otu oyekponu da awoleha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">iyinyinyi nu yaba ko gbobgo-gbogbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Kweyi Owuso ni ya do osheho edo kizire kpo ozarore ni, oya dala edo koza kpiri ni ala ba doka ni, kweyi yayo ya gye shini ala kyizire nwashika ikweyi koza neshi kala ni ala ya ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Oya yala ba gbodu shini ala wawo zeshi ishi kpiri, kweyi ase nwashika ba shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi keshi kala ni anye ni.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Oko ni ala ya mani dase ko Owuso oza kin lalo, oki yotunehe do Owuso ya kyokye bwipu wa. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Bwebe ko oko ni ala ya mani, ni sayi koza neshi kala ni, ase nwashika ba sho Owuso iye koni ala geyagye do Oshu Neshi ko Okristi ni ala ba ka ni, kpeshi ni ala yuwa kpase ashini ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kweyi aba tinarigwu dala kpimu yoya nwashika ikweyi ke eshi ko Owuso ni sheyi gagye ipu kala ni. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />An shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi ke eshi nu ni gbo koka lo ni!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Obulus Nyagbo ko Oko nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ami Obulus abiyun, ni ase ba mo ishini ni nyyebe kala ni, nyya ya byo nyya yoshi, kweyi ishi ni nshebe kala bita, nyya yoshi kelo. Ipu kiye ko Okristi ni gbotumene kpiyinyinyi ni, <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />nyya bala mo ala ka yun na gbapwo kpala lo ishini nwwa; ngye kwokwoshi mo nyya gege ya gbapwo kpawase ni kamo aha ba yoza owe ni ase kese ba ya ni. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ko kwokwoshi aha bese mani, aha ke ba kpefu byoni ase kese ba kpo ni lalo. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Iyo kefu ni aba kpefu kpanu ni wa kese lalo, ake wiyo kefu ko Owuso ni loshu ni la, aba yoko kpawa ko yawole koshu kye, aba yawashu kokame kye; <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />aba yojoji ni ya gwakya ko yase owe gwu ko gyo Owuso ni kye; aba yotu wonyonya shetu ko yuwa na geyagye do Okristi. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Kweyi ishini ogeyagye kala wa gya, aba gbawase ni geyagye lo ni ogo agye.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ala ba moza byoni awe iyi kpiyi ni kin la. Owoni ase ashini kala kamo awa wako Okristi, ana kyi kyanu ma neneshi, ikweyi koni aha wa ko Okristi byoni awa we ni. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Owoni ngwabotu shoshu ikweyi koshu ni Adole daha ni, nyya yiweyi lo, oshu ko zala iso, wako yala gbo lalo. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Nyya yimu shini naka lebyo nyya taloshi kpo awokpa ni nta ni lo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ashe ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Okpa kikpiye ko Obulus senu ki loshu. Ishini oke yo kpaha ni oya kela loshu-loshu mani lo, kweyi ela nu wojije!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Ase mani na gye kamo ozoza ni ata ipu kokpa kaha ni pini aba wa ya ishini abebe kala la.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kokwokwoshi, aba kiyikaha lo ake ba myi iyikaha kpase ni ba miyiwa wojoji ni lo. Awikyo la! Aba myiyiwa kpoza ni shuwotu ni, kweyi aba ziyiwa soza ni ama mo oshoshi ni! <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Aha ke ba gwabotu shoza ni awe ni lo, aba gwabotu ikweyi koko ni Owuso daha koya ni kin la, oko ni aha ya gebebe kala ni. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Aha gwabotu shoshu lo koni awebe kala ni, ko byo Oshu Neshi ko Okristi wa dala. Abi webe kala lo abi ba maha gwabotu shoshu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ake ba gwabotu ikweyi koko ni ase ashini ya ni ko gwebe ni Owuso she daha ni ta lalo. Abishi koni, aha kpiyi shagye mo otuse kala ya gye, shini an gege ko ki yoko shoshe ebe kala, ipu kishi kpiri aba gwoyi ni Owuso myi daha ni ta lo. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ebeni aba pyo oshu ko tono ko Oshu Neshi go okpagye ashini ni gwala ta ni shini an ka gwabotu kpoko ni akwobonu ya agbabo kashe hoha ni lo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Okpa ko Owuso ke kamo, &lt;&lt;Aseni ya gwabotu na gwabotu ipu ka Adole.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Koni ase ni kiyinu ni pini ya pya abokpa lalo, Ase ni Adole ke kela neshi ikweyi nu pini ya pya abokpa la.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Obulus kpa Ayikoko ko Okame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ala bi gbo otumene kpami koni nwwikyo gbayayi ni, nyya bala! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Nyya kpipu dala byoni Owuso ya ya ni; ala wisonya ni nshokoyi ko do ongo oye kpokponu ni, ongo oni wo Okristi abiyinu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Nyya yoshi ela koni aba yalotu pya kweyi ala ba ziyikala kpiri-kpiri do Okristi lo, byoni egwa gya Awawu egya kpokame nu ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ikweyi koni ala ba zase kpiri ni webe kala wa tono ko Oyesu oye hoha ni kpo otunehe, wanu ni aha tono nu ni lalo; kweyi ala nyo omaku oye kpo oshu neshi oye gogo kpo Omaku kpo oshu neshi ni ala nye ebe kaha ni! <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Nke mamo ayikoko nyakwu kala ni shun lo! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Oye lo nwwase ni tayoyo ya fela koka ni la, oke webe koza gyogye lalo; agwoza mani kpiri dala ishi kpiri owe wonyonya.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Owo ozalabi ni nyya byiyun wokpagye shini na zala iso bwebe ko tono koshu neshi ko Owuso dala yeye ni la? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ishi ni nyya yoko ipu kala ni, awoda ko Owuso ashini pini ba sumore la. Na kamo nzuwoza oshu ko talabo. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kweyi ishini nyyebe kala ni, ishini nyya yimu koje, nwwegye da ashishe kala ko tumabo lo, ayene ni wa bwo Omasedoniya ni ba dami ojoji ni nyya yimu ni. Byoni nwwegye dala ishi oni lo ni, nki ya wegye dala ohobu lo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Bwebe kokwokwoshi ko Okristi ni yipu hin ni, ashishe ipu ka agye ka Akaya ya gege ya wumobi ko gwabotu kpoza mani lo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Nyya kela mani ikweyi koni nyya yimu kala lo ni la? Owuso gye mo nyya yimu kala! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Nyya gohobu ko yoza ni nyya ya anani, shini ayikoko oni naka pyoshu ko gwabotu mawa gyogye kpa aha ipu koko naba yani lo. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Koni awa ayikoko ko okame la, oko wa wako gyasegya, ba yiyiwa pya bya ayikoko ko Okristi kokwokwoshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ogbigbashi lo, owoni Ibiri ya yiyinu pya byo oyoleho ke ebe yoyu! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Mani oni owojije lalo, owoni ayole nu yi iyiwa pya bya ayole koza neshi. Okweyi wa ya gyogye kpoza ni aya ni.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owe Moma ko Obulus Abishi ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Nki ya kyanu ka: ashishe naka mun byikyo lo. Owoni ala ke ma mani, ala zun byoni ala ba zikyo ni, shini na pyoza gbayayi ni nyya gwabotu kpanu ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Kokwokwoshi ela ni nyya ka mani wela ni Adole ya yimu shini na ka ni lalo, ipu kela ko gwabotu mani nke ya kela byikyo kwokwoshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ikweyi koni ase ashini ba gwabotu ikweyi kela kasuse shishi ni, ami ya gwabotu mamani. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ala ba zotu kpa awikyo kpotunehe, ikweyi koni ala mala ziyi ni! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ala ba zotu kpa awase ni jalabo ni, kpawase ni ba gyalegya ni, kpawase ni ba zeda dala kwe awase ni ba mala gyiyi lo ni, kwe awase ni ba lalabo akpaha ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Nyya yiweyi ko kyogwu maha yoshi ko ya mani!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Oza kpiri ni ashe ke ya gwabotu ikweyi nu, nyya kela byikyo la, ami ya gwabotu ikweyi nu mamani. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Owoni awase ki Ibru la, ami we mamani. Owoni awase ki Izrayila la, ami we mamani. Owoni awayi ki Ibirayi la, ami we mamani. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Owoni ayole ko Okristi la, nyya kela byo onyoza, nwwo oyole neshi shuwa! Nyyoko shuwa, nggo oruduru shuwa, ayuma aboshi ko otata shuwa, kweyi nmi ikwu iyi shuwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Igbeho Ase ko Oyahuda yuma aboshi aweta ayahane; <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />ase ko Oroma yuma aboshi igbeta; kweyi atuma akyo igbo oye, owu kinyo kya kpami igbeta, nngmeno oye ipu kinyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Nyyipu kiyawu ishi kpiri, inyo bi yun re, awi bi yun ngmo, awase hin abiyiwa tiyi ko yun ngmo, awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni tiyi ko yun ngmo; nmikwu ipu kogya, nmikwu ipu kakyashi, nmikwu ipu ki ishu, nmikwu ebe kayene kokame. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nyyoko lono-lono, ishi nwashika ngbola lo; emye ngmun, igini ngmun, ishi nwashika ozarore yaba dami lo; ole yaba dami lo, kweyi ngbiyo ko shoko lo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Oza shishini wa ko koka lo, ngbo otubyobya kurutu ikweyi ka awogboso Oyesu kpiri. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Owoni ashe gboshu lo, ami ya gboshu lo mamani; owoni ashe gbo ipu kozalabi, otu hin ya fo.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Owoni nyya gwabotu, nyya gwabotu ikweyi kawoza ni sayi mo ngboshu lo ni. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Owuso, Ada ka Adole Oyesu an shaniye ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Gye kamo nyya kokame lalo. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ishini nyyo Odamasko ni, ogbolamaga ni yo otu ko ose Areta ni sha awogbeho gofunu-oba mo ana ga yun kwu. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ake yun teba ipu ko ogwugwu kweyi tun bwowu oye ipu kokpe ome npa shabo wa la.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Osayi ko Obulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Nyya gwabotu, koni ogbeshi ko ojije lo ni. Nke ya kela koza ni Adole gwamiyi ma ni mina. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ngyongo oye ipu ko Okristi, ishayi igwene ni shigbo ni azo giso ko omweta (ngye lo kwe ogbodagye ipu kikpiye la kwe ipu komaku, Owuso pini gye la.) <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Nki gye mo ongo mani kwe oyipu kikpiye la kwipu komaku, Owuso pini gye la. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Azo gi iso ga pwo oza ni okwunu ka asuse ya gege ya ka lo ni, ela ni ada asuse oshu ko ka lo ni.<verse eid="2CO 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Mani oni nyya gwabotu kpo ongo mani, nke ya gwabotu kpi iyun lo, nke ya gwabotu ebe ni ngboshu lo ni. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Owoni nyyimu ko gwabotu, nyya wikyo lo, ikweyi koni nyya kokwokwoshi la. Nke ya gwabotu lo, shini ashishe naka kami shoshu lo, bwebe koza ni nyya ni kwela ni ala pwo okwunu hin ni.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Shini naka zikweyi iso ikweyi kawoza kigbashi ni nma ni lo, adami igye ikpiye hin, ni wo oyoleho ki Ibiri ni, ko tumoshi shini naka zikweyi iso lo. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ntinarigwu igbeta shini Adole na yi bize shun. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Oke nyumagbo mo, &lt;&lt;Eshi hin gbayi awo, oshu hin ya yoko neshi ebe ni ase nye ni la.&gt;&gt; Mani oni, nyya gohobu ko gwabotu kpo otunehe ikweyi ko nyonye hin, shini oshu ko Okristi na yipu hin. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Abishi ko Okristi, nyya shotunehe ipu ko nyonye hin, ipu kesa, ipu ko owe moma, kpo ozalono. Koni ishini oshu hin nye, nyya loshu.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Dotu Ose Ikweyi Kase ko Okorentus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Nyyiyun ya wikyo, ala pini ke yun ya mani la. Ala pini shu ko kami la. Koni nwwojije lo ni, ayikoko nyakwu kala ni shun kpojije lo. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Awoza kigbashi nwashika ni nyya ipu kala kpotumene ni shala mo nwwo oyikoko ko Oyesu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Nyyo oda ko Owuso oyoye oneshi shala lo, oza ni nke yala ni pini wo ni nwwegye dala lo ni kin la. Ala rigbun koni nyyala gyogye lo ni!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Anani nwwiyunshu wa ko gbaloga komweta, kwikyikyeni nki ya wegye dala lo, ikweyi koni oza ni nyya yimu ni woza ni ala gbo ni lalo, ala pini nyya yimu la. Ayi pini ba tikpo koza da ase ni muwa ni lalo, ase ni mayi ni pini ya tikpo koza dayi nu la. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Mani oni, nyya yiyun kpo ojoji ni ngbo ni ya ngmo dala kpo otunehe. Ala ba yimu hin gbayayi koni nyya yimu kala nwashika ni?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Byoni owe ni, ala ba kyogwu kpami mo nwwegye dala lo. Ashe ke ya kamo nyyaloziyi, kweyi ngyalegya kpokame. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Owe wonya? Nyyaloziyi bwebe kase ni ntoleho ebe kala ni? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Nbo Otitus mona gebe kala kweyi ntoyene oye oleho ga kpanu, kwe ala ba mo Otitus yaloza iyi la? Aayi, ami kpanu gbotu oye kponu kweyi ki ba yoza kaha owe oye kponu lalo? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Oye lo ala ba ma bya ba yimu ko nyepwo kiyikaha dala la. Aayi! Aba kela byoni Okristi ya yimu kaha koka obutu ko Owuso ni, kweyi ojoji ni aba ya, aba ya ko talabo la, ayene hin moshi. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Nyya yoshi mo ishi ni nwwa, nyya wa mala gogo kpoza ni nyya yimu shala we ni, kweyi ala ba mun gogo kpoza ni ala ba yimu shini na we ni. Nyya yoshi mo nyya wa ta apwo gbogbo, kpanya yoya, kpotu yoya, kpo yimu kiyo shase, kpesa sosa, olokwunu agye, zikweyi iso, kpo yoza waya ipu kala. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Nyya yoshi ela koni ishini nki wa, Owuso hin ya tumiweyi obutu kala, kweyi nyya byotu ikweyi kase nwashika ni yozalabi itikpi kweyi shagbotu kozalabi wa lo ni: ikweyi keba boba, kpoza bibi shishini naba ya ni.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Akpaha Pyopyi ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Omani wako omweta ni nyya wa gbaloga ni pini yoma. Okpa ko Owuso ka mo, &lt;&lt;Aba yo okwokwoshi kepwo kpiri ya ngmeyi bwebe ko olobene kase epa kwe eta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Nyya yimu ko ka dala ni yozalabi ga itikpi ni kpase ashini kpiri, byoni nkwobonu ka dala owowa hin ko omwepa ni, nki ya kyanu ka anani ni nyyo kpala lo ni: ishini nki wa nyya gbalogo agye kpiri, nyya shashishe bita lo. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ikweyi koni ala ba mojoji ni ala ba yimu ko ma ome shini ala kyogwu mo Okristi ya kela bwebe hin ni. Osha ebe ko yoza kpala lo, oke sayi koshu nu ipu kala. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Koni olema byo Okristi gboshu lo ni ayo poshi ni, bwebe koshu ko Owuso pini oki yiyi la. Ipu kema kaha kpanu aha loshu lo mamani; ipu kema kaha kpala ke aba gbingbo koshu ko Owuso ipu ko olayi nu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ala miyikala ma shini ala gye kwe ala bipu ko otuse. Ala gye mo Okristi Oyesu yipu kala lo? Owoni olemani lo, ala zigbo oma. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ntotuse mala ba gye maha zigbo lo. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Anani aba bo Owuso shini ala ka yo ojije labi lo, shini ase na gye maha rogwa lalo, shini ala ke yoza ni shoshi ni, koni ole byaha zigbo ni. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Koni aba tela ko okwokwoshi lo, ake ba hagye do okwokwoshi la. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ashotunehe ishi ni aha gboshu lo ala ke gboshu; kweyi aba tinarigwu shini ala gya.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ozani yun tokpa mani ishini nyyo kpala lo ni oma; shini ishini nwwa, naka wa gbalapwo nwashika bwebe ko yoko kpo oshu hin ni Adole dami ni lo, oshu ko zala iso, wa ko yala gbo lalo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ogwejeji, ayene hin, Owuso na gbaha! Ala takirikwu shini ala gya; ala pwoboba hin; ala kyogwu kpiyikala, ala bagye ipu ko omene. Kweyi Owuso kimu kpo omene ya yo kpala.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ala tiyikala ogbogba kweyi kwiyikala botu ipu ko omene.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Eshi ka Adole Oyesu kristi, kpimu ko Owuso, kpo ogeyagye ko Omaku Sere nayo kpa ala kpiri.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, kpimu ko Owuso, kpema ko Omaku ko Owuso na yo kpala kpiri.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>